
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lê Minh Nhật | Usagi's World ♡</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;1,600&display=swap');

:root {
  --pink: #e99cba;
  --light: #fff4f8;
  --dark: #533b50;
  --purple: #c4b2e8;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
  color: var(--dark);
  background: #fff8fb;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: -1;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, #fce1ef, transparent 35%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 70%, #e9e1ff, transparent 35%);
}

nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 18px 8%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: #fff8f8e8;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  z-index: 100;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f5dce8;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 23px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #df83a8;
}

nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--dark);
  margin-left: 22px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: .3s;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #e38bad;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 130px 12% 70px;
  gap: 45px;
}

.hero-text {
  max-width: 540px;
  animation: appear 1s ease;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #f4d2e1;
  padding: 9px 17px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #d77fa2;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(45px, 6vw, 76px);
  line-height: 1.2;
  font-weight: 600;
}

h1 span {
  color: #e99cba;
  font-style: italic;
}

.student-number {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding: 9px 18px;
  border: 1px solid #f3c5d9;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #fff0f6;
  color: #d77fa2;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.hero-text p.description {
  margin-top: 23px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: #8e788d;
  max-width: 430px;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 30px;
  padding: 15px 26px;
  background: #e99cba;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 35px;
  font-weight: 700;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #e99cba45;
  transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  background: #d980a3;
}

.hero-art {
  width: 350px;
  height: 390px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 48% 48% 35% 35%;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffe4ef, #e8defd);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: 0 25px 60px #d8b5d42e;
  animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.bunny {
  font-size: 150px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 10px #c08ba044);
}

.floating {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 28px;
  animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.star1 { top: 45px; left: 38px; }
.star2 { right: 30px; top: 100px; animation-delay: .7s; }
.star3 { bottom: 65px; left: 45px; animation-delay: 1.2s; }

.scroll-note {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #b59bad;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  padding-bottom: 25px;
}

section:not(.hero) {
  padding: 100px 12%;
}

.section-heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.section-heading small {
  color: #df8bab;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 46px);
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.section-heading p {
  margin-top: 12px;
  color: #a18b9e;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}

.card {
  padding: 30px 24px;
  background: #ffffffc9;
  border: 1px solid #f3dce8;
  border-radius: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: .35s;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #b990ae0a;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  box-shadow: 0 15px 35px #dbaac52b;
}

.card .icon {
  font-size: 39px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.card h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
  color: #99859a;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.favorites {
  background: #fff0f6;
  border-radius: 45px;
  margin: 0 3%;
}

.favorite-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}

.favorite {
  border-radius: 25px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: white;
  transition: .3s;
}

.favorite:hover {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

.favorite-art {
  height: 180px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 75px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe0ed, #eee5ff);
}

.favorite:nth-child(2) .favorite-art {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e4e7ff, #ffe8f1);
}

.favorite:nth-child(3) .favorite-art {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0d8, #f7dcec);
}

.favorite-info {
  padding: 23px;
}

.favorite-info h3 {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.favorite-info p {
  color: #a18b9e;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.quote {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 90px 15% !important;
}

.big-heart {
  font-size: 38px;
}

.quote blockquote {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 37px);
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 25px auto;
}

.quote p {
  color: #c48ba6;
  font-size: 13px;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 15px;
  border-top: 1px solid #f3dce8;
  color: #aa8da2;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 2;
}

footer span {
  color: #e58eaf;
}

#hearts {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 999;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.heart {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 22px;
  animation: rise 1.5s ease-out forwards;
}

@keyframes rise {
  from {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(.5);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  to {
    transform: translateY(-130px) scale(1.4);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-13px); }
}

@keyframes appear {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
  nav { padding: 16px 5%; }
  nav a { margin-left: 9px; font-size: 10px; }

  .hero {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 130px 7% 60px;
  }

  .hero-text p.description {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-art {
    width: 280px;
    height: 310px;
  }

  .bunny { font-size: 120px; }

  .about-grid, .favorite-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  section:not(.hero) { padding: 75px 7%; }
  .favorites { margin: 0 2%; }
  .quote { padding: 75px 8% !important; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: .01ms !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition-duration: .01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="hearts"></div>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">♡ USAGI</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#home">HOME</a>
    <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
    <a href="#favorites">FAVORITES</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="tag">🐰 WELCOME TO MY LITTLE WORLD</div>

    <h1>Hello, I'm<br><span>Lê Minh Nhật.</span></h1>

    <div class="student-number">✦ HỌC SINH · SỐ 30 ✦</div>

    <p class="description">
      Chào mừng đến với thế giới nhỏ của tao!
      Tao là Lê Minh Nhật, số 30.
      Đây là góc riêng lưu giữ sở thích,
      những ước mơ và những điều làm tao vui.
      Rất vui vì mày đã ghé thăm! ♡
    </p>

    <a href="#about" class="btn">Khám phá thế giới của tao ♡</a>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-art">
    <span class="floating star1">✧</span>
    <span class="floating star2">♡</span>
    <span class="floating star3">✦</span>
    <div class="bunny">🐰</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="scroll-note">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</div>

<section id="about">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <small>✿ A LITTLE ABOUT ME ✿</small>
    <h2>Get to know me</h2>
    <p>Một chút về Lê Minh Nhật.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎀</div>
      <h3>Who am I?</h3>
      <p>Tao là Lê Minh Nhật, học sinh số 30. Đây là website giới thiệu bản thân mang phong cách Usagi dễ thương.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌷</div>
      <h3>My personality</h3>
      <p>Tao luôn muốn khám phá những điều mới, tận hưởng những khoảnh khắc vui vẻ và tạo ra kỷ niệm đáng nhớ.</p>
